# Custom mission map selection (solo play) on the procedural UI system. Title top-left; one panel with the map list,
# the preview of the highlighted map (start positions placed on it by code) and the difficulty switch as a segmented
# control; Back at the left of the bottom bar, Start at the right. Units: 1 = frame height / 1080.
hide $MapSelectMenuParent
window $SubParent left top 0 0 1920 1080
hide $SubParent

window text:GUI:CustomMission left top 64 40 560 48 title
ruler left top 64 94 560

panel left top 64 124 1792 832
window $ListboxMap left top 84 150 1200 620 list
window $WinMapPreview left top 1324 150 512 384
window text:GUI:SelectDifficulty left top 84 800 400 24 meta
window $RadioButtonEasyAI left top 84 832 220 40 radio
window $RadioButtonMediumAI left top 308 832 220 40 radio
window $RadioButtonHardAI left top 532 832 220 40 radio

window $ButtonBack left bottom 64 40 180 44 button
window $ButtonOK right bottom 64 40 280 44 primary
